From: Andrew Branson <andrew.branson@jolla.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:05:50 +0300
Subject: Version the EmbedLite libxul SONAME

Use the Gecko major and minor version as the ELF ABI generation for the
Sailfish EmbedLite build. This lets patch-level security updates replace
Gecko without requiring downstream rebuilds, while minor updates require a
matching QtMoz build.

Mozilla's SONAME property accepts a base name and appends the platform
suffix, so pass the complete versioned name to the ELF linker.
---
 toolkit/library/moz.build | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/toolkit/library/moz.build b/toolkit/library/moz.build
index 57af0569c4bc..5438051bef05 100644
--- a/toolkit/library/moz.build
+++ b/toolkit/library/moz.build
@@ -23,6 +23,13 @@ def Libxul(name, output_category=None):
         GeckoSharedLibrary(name, output_category=output_category)
         SHARED_LIBRARY_NAME = "xul"
 
+        if (
+            CONFIG["MOZ_BUILD_APP"] == "mobile/sailfishos"
+            and CONFIG["OS_ARCH"] == "Linux"
+        ):
+            embedlite_abi = ".".join(CONFIG["MOZ_APP_VERSION"].split(".")[:2])
+            LDFLAGS += ["-Wl,-soname,libxul.so.%s" % embedlite_abi]
+
     DELAYLOAD_DLLS += [
         "avrt.dll",
         "comdlg32.dll",
